{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Humiliate the world's leading &quot;philanthropist&quot;,</i> <br><br>Take the role as a Puppetmaster and his associates in a colorful dystopian fantasy world, discover twists and mysteries during your attempt to &quot;secure&quot; a valuable treasure from a powerful aristocrat. <br><br>Treasure of Trials is a low res pixel art action puzzle platformer with gory combat and a tint of satire and dark humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player linear story based campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Variety in playstyle between characters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mixture of hack and slash, platforming and puzzle solving.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlocking multiple abilities throughout the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra couch coop and pvp maps.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036830?t=1759649225","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036830/295526a1b96c0f49885c87bf26e3adac8c29fd55/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759649225","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036830/3590653b0413f95e420de185951175c0b88082fa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759649225","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036830/3590653b0413f95e420de185951175c0b88082fa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759649225","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together",